# Switching Ornithopter's 0/2 makes it 2/0, which state-based actions put into the graveyard (CR 704.5f); Twisted Image has already resolved, so Bot1 still draws its card.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Twisted Image
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Twisted Image.Cast(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass

